	"nodes":[
		{"id":"fd680d8183c25863","type":"file","file":"Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_8_Virtual_Memory/05-計算機組織_TOPIC_8_Virtual_Me.png","x":-200,"y":-220,"width":400,"height":98},
		{"id":"ca64228b732911e6","type":"file","file":"Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_8_Virtual_Memory/04-計算機組織_TOPIC_8_Virtual_Me.png","x":300,"y":-306,"width":400,"height":86},
		{"id":"1511047840442d86","type":"text","text":"- 動機\n\t1. 也就是可以一次多個執行程式碼且有效率也安全\n\t2. 程式碼的大小可以超過 main 的 memory 大小","x":760,"y":-310,"width":440,"height":94,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"cb29bcdc9e911716","type":"file","file":"Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_8_Virtual_Memory/12-計算機組織_TOPIC_8_Virtual_Me.png","x":300,"y":-100,"width":400,"height":69},
		{"id":"24d3cd455c6b90aa","type":"file","file":"Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_8_Virtual_Memory/14-計算機組織_TOPIC_8_Virtual_Me.png","x":300,"y":60,"width":400,"height":233},
		{"id":"4334b9145242b7f3","type":"text","text":"1. Virtual space 在跟 Memory 做對應\n2. CPU 發出的的位置是去存取 Virtual Space","x":777,"y":-96,"width":439,"height":61,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"1125b79e9f64ebf0","type":"file","file":"Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_8_Virtual_Memory/21-選擇概念都是使用儘量不要操作到硬碟.png","x":300,"y":420,"width":400,"height":222},
		{"id":"81fe77ff569e0734","type":"text","text":"- VPN 是指 Virtual Page Number\n- Physical Page Number\n- 其實就是 block 只是名詞不同歷史意義\n- 同時可以不同程式碼會有很多個 Virtual Space 和 Physical Memory 去做對應","x":777,"y":98,"width":471,"height":157,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"a284873d5382af7d","type":"text","text":"- 選擇概念都是使用儘量不要操作到硬碟","x":777,"y":502,"width":363,"height":58,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"3d1b80e34b013dcf","type":"file","file":"Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_8_Virtual_Memory/20-計算機組織_TOPIC_8_Virtual_Me.png","x":2130,"y":380,"width":482,"height":260},
		{"id":"528fc339326d91b0","type":"file","file":"Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_8_Virtual_Memory/15-計算機組織_TOPIC_8_Virtual_Me.png","x":1410,"y":68,"width":573,"height":326},
		{"id":"7022b2481663839b","type":"file","file":"Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_8_Virtual_Memory/03-計算機組織_TOPIC_8_Virtual_Me.png","x":1430,"y":-376,"width":554,"height":320},
		{"id":"32aae0d9534d45a8","type":"text","text":"- 這邊的 vail bit 是在說這個資料有沒有在 physical memory ，btw memory 是指是不是有效資料\n- 那麼這張就是使用 Page Table Virtual -> Physical","x":2120,"y":-261,"width":420,"height":91,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"0f7a3490a8c97c77","type":"file","file":"Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_8_Virtual_Memory/13-計算機組織_TOPIC_8_Virtual_Me.png","x":2130,"y":-56,"width":399,"height":299},
		{"id":"674fed3c9d4a4ac9","type":"file","file":"Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_8_Virtual_Memory/23-選擇概念都是使用儘量不要操作到硬碟.png","x":1350,"y":560,"width":694,"height":398},
		{"id":"4f8282b048b7d192","type":"file","file":"Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_8_Virtual_Memory/26-計算機組織_TOPIC_8_Virtual_Me.png","x":1360,"y":1520,"width":576,"height":320},
		{"id":"86ae016ec7316eee","type":"text","text":"- OS 處理 Page fult 那麼會發出 Exception 然後並且使用 LUR 的 page replacement algo\n- Cache miss 是由 Cache controller 處理","x":2120,"y":1186,"width":430,"height":121,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"6d8c8290a3935523","type":"file","file":"Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_8_Virtual_Memory/25-計算機組織_TOPIC_8_Virtual_Me.png","x":1350,"y":1080,"width":694,"height":333},
		{"id":"a77d5aeb462c1468","type":"text","text":"- dirty bit 如果是 1 代表了他在 main memory 被寫過了，會跟 virtual space 不一致，反之，並且一開始是 0 是 OS 設定的\n\t- 如果發現是 1 那麼就要 copy 到 virtual space\n\t- 用來決定要不要 write back\n- 那麼這個就是用 ref bit 也就是用 `LRU 近似`，有被 CPU 存取過那麼就會那麼就會被 OS 轉成 1 然後 OS 會定期來清理 (OS) 會說以下幾種\n\t-  Additional reference bits usage\n\t- second chance\n\t- Enhanced second change","x":2131,"y":1562,"width":419,"height":315,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"bd522c43916cb9a1","type":"file","file":"Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_8_Virtual_Memory/27-計算機組織_TOPIC_8_Virtual_Me.png","x":1995,"y":1960,"width":692,"height":280},
